  "type" : "richtext",
  "display_width" : null,
  "default" : "<p>MDCo runs from <strong>100 Clinton Square.</strong> Same downtown, same winters, same handshake economy where a reputation takes years to build and one bad quarter to dent. Syracuse rewards companies that show up and do the work, and that is exactly how we consult.</p><p>We work exclusively with technology companies: managed service providers, VARs, solution providers, and IT start-ups. Some of them are ten minutes from our office. Most are not. <strong>Being local means you get partners you can sit across from</strong>, not an account manager three time zones away reading a status report.</p><p>If you run a tech company in CNY, the Mohawk Valley, or the Finger Lakes and growth has stalled at referrals, that is a conversation worth having. We win because we've been in your shoes.</p>"
